# ── Large asset staging, deliberately not versioned ────────────────────────
# Neither folder is referenced by any component on Home 01 or Home 02, and
# together they are ~291 MB. Git keeps binaries forever, so committing them
# would make every future clone carry them whether or not they are ever used.
# The files stay on disk — this only keeps them out of history.
#
# public/new image/  raw drops and AI-generated staging (444.png, hero222.png,
#                    Gemini_Generated_Image_*.png, duplicates of placed art)
# public/images/_archive/  photographs already retired and replaced
/public/new image/
/public/images/_archive/
